<Slide style={{ width: '1280px', height: '720px', background: '#FFFFFF', padding: '20px 70px', display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column' }}><Box style={{ height: 100, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'flex-end' }}><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 6 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#7A8699', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.4, letterSpacing: 1 }}>08 / 教学协同 Agent</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 32, color: '#0E2340', fontWeight: 700, lineHeight: 1.3 }}>可靠性三原则</Text></Box><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', padding: '7px 16px', borderRadius: 20, background: '#1E7BE0' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#FFFFFF', fontWeight: 600 }}>设计中</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{ height: 532, paddingTop: 8, flexDirection: 'column' }}><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', flex: 1, justifyContent: 'center', gap: 18 }}><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 20, flex: 1 }}><Box style={{ width: 366, background: '#FFFFFF', border: '1px solid #E3E8EF', borderRadius: 8, overflow: 'hidden', flexDirection: 'column' }}><Box style={{ height: 4, background: 'linear-gradient(90deg, #1E7BE0 0%, #00A9B5 100%)' }} /><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 10, padding: 20, flex: 1 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 24, color: '#0E2340', fontWeight: 600, lineHeight: 1.4 }}>先查系统</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#333A45', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.6 }}>能从授权系统查询时先查系统；资料不足时只询问影响任务的必要信息。</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{ width: 366, background: '#FFFFFF', border: '1px solid #E3E8EF', borderRadius: 8, overflow: 'hidden', flexDirection: 'column' }}><Box style={{ height: 4, background: 'linear-gradient(90deg, #1E7BE0 0%, #00A9B5 100%)' }} /><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 10, padding: 20, flex: 1 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 24, color: '#0E2340', fontWeight: 600, lineHeight: 1.4 }}>不臆断错因</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#333A45', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.6 }}>用户询问原因时先给出可核对观察；原因有多种解释时安排诊断或保留未知，不能为完成回答而确定一个未经证实的错因。</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{ width: 366, background: '#FFFFFF', border: '1px solid #E3E8EF', borderRadius: 8, overflow: 'hidden', flexDirection: 'column' }}><Box style={{ height: 4, background: 'linear-gradient(90deg, #1E7BE0 0%, #00A9B5 100%)' }} /><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 10, padding: 20, flex: 1 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 24, color: '#0E2340', fontWeight: 600, lineHeight: 1.4 }}>以业务结果为准</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#333A45', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.6 }}>任务完成以实际执行结果为依据，不用聊天流畅度或工具调用次数代替教学效果。</Text></Box></Box></Box><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', background: '#F5F7FA', borderLeft: '4px solid #00A9B5', borderRadius: 6, padding: '14px 20px' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#0E2340', fontWeight: 600, lineHeight: 1.5 }}>信息获取、归因纪律与完成判定，是协同 Agent 区别于普通聊天助手的三条底线</Text></Box></Box></Box><Box style={{ height: 40, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'center', borderTop: '1px solid #E3E8EF', marginTop: 8 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#7A8699', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.4 }}>依据：教学协同Agent设计.md §3</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#7A8699', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.4 }}> 80 / 124 </Text></Box></Slide>